                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "While this is potentially a client breaking change, it is:\n1. In line with the specification\n2. Something where there has been significant change over the years in the spec\n3. Something a reasonably correct client would generally code against, or only use the value as a string directly (not interpret as an int).\n4. Might be a regression recently.\n\nTherefore I think it's acceptable to not have a backward compatibility path.  If we find anyone hits a problem, we can offer a backward compatibility path at a later time."
                },
